# LF in the working tree on every platform: specs compare fixture files
# byte for byte, and Git for Windows would otherwise check them out as CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.odt binary
*.docx binary
*.zip binary
# iCalendar uses CRLF (RFC 5545): keep these as they are
*.ics -text
*.cmd text eol=crlf
